  "caveats": [
    "Isolated-kernel timings measured alongside an idle serving container; absolute us noisier than the dedicated fp8 sweep, cross-engine ratios within the same run are the signal.",
    "cublas_mxfp8 timing covers the GEMM only: production integration must pre-block weight scales at load (one-time) and fuse activation quant to e4m3+e8m0-blocked layout per call; that fused-quant cost is not measured here.",
    "cuda_custom writes fp32 split-K partials reduced by torch.sum in the timing loop for sk>1 cells (included in its time).",
    "No serving integration performed; no end-to-end claim."
  ],
